abstract: >-
  Research code accompanying Simulation-Based Alignment Research for Embodied
  Agents: A Colosseum Testbed for Autonomous UAVs in Civilian Defence. Includes
  the frozen controller, runtime safeguards, independent evaluation, protocols,
  and tools for checking the separately supplied compact evidence archive.
